<title>USA: Itron files suit against CellNet.</title>
<headline>Itron files suit against CellNet.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Itron Inc said Thursday it has filed a patent infringement suit against CellNet Data Systems.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in the U.S. District Court of Minnesota, claims that CellNet's WAN radio system violates Itron's U.S. Patent No. 5,553,094 which was issued on September 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Itron, a provider of automatic meter reading services and equipment to the utility industry, said in a statement CellNet has declined to discuss a licensing agreement with Itron.</p>
</text>
